From e0ae0d8048c52b37e7635c5642fec2222b4e1510 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Signbot AutoDL <zhengsw200304@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 07:17:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] MotionLib: configurable hand dir, hand/body frame check,
 lerp hand angles, fix pkl cache

- hand poses were loaded from a hardcoded /data1/guanren/CSL-Daily path; now from
  the yaml's top-level hand_root, $SIGNBOT_HAND_DIR, or <root>/../target_linker_hand.
- assert hand and body clips have the same number of frames (they share offsets).
- hand joint angles were interpolated with quaternion slerp on a 30-d vector; use lerp.
- torch.cat on an empty list crashed when hand_flag=False.
- pkl cache: create the pkl dir, detect a stale cache, and continue instead of exit()
  after building it on the first run.
---
 ASE/ase/utils/motion_lib.py | 83 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 65 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ASE/ase/utils/motion_lib.py b/ASE/ase/utils/motion_lib.py
index cf4a520..4335700 100644
--- a/ASE/ase/utils/motion_lib.py
+++ b/ASE/ase/utils/motion_lib.py
